=== controls ===
C1 line at infinity has K-multiplicity -3: PASS
C2 free chain multiplicities [-2, -1, 0, 1, 2] (expect [-2,-1,0,1,2]): PASS
C3 satellite(L,E1) multiplicity -4 (expect -4): PASS
multiplicity calculus: VALIDATED

=== sieve applied to free-chain depths ===
  depth 1: multiplicity -2  -> KILLED
  depth 2: multiplicity -1  -> KILLED
  depth 3: multiplicity +0  -> SURVIVES
  depth 4: multiplicity +1  -> SURVIVES
  depth 5: multiplicity +2  -> SURVIVES

Reading: any candidate whose dicritical component sits within
two free blow-ups of the line at infinity is killed outright.
A counterexample needs a dicritical component at free-depth >= 3,
and satellite blow-ups only make multiplicities more negative.
